# Results
- The lab was completed successfully. Linux users and groups were created, file ownership was configured, and permissions were applied correctly. Access control was verified using different user accounts.

# Conclusion
- This practical improved understanding of Linux administration, user management, group handling, and file permissions. The lab also provided hands-on experience with Linux security fundamentals and access control mechanisms used in cyber security environments.

